<title>FRANCE: L'Oreal nine-month sales up 12.2 pct.</title>
<headline>L'Oreal nine-month sales up 12.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996,</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					44,592    vs   39,752</p>
<p>NOTE -The company gave the results in the official BALO bulletin. It said that on a comparable basis, its turnover rose 7.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
